<Page title="About GarageRecoveryLab" description="Who runs GarageRecoveryLab, what we cover, and how we stay independent.">
  <p>GarageRecoveryLab helps people buy expensive home recovery equipment without regret: saunas, cold plunges, hot tubs, swim spas, massage chairs, and the garage gym gear that goes with them.</p>
  <h2>Why this site exists</h2>
  <p>Most "best sauna" lists are written by retailers selling the products or by publishers who never mention running costs, wiring, or what happens when a heater fails in year three. We focus on the questions buyers actually ask before spending $3,000 to $15,000.</p>
  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>GarageRecoveryLab is an independent, owner-operated site based in the United States. Our editors research every product against manufacturer specs, owner reports and, where we can, hands-on use.</p>
  <h2>How we stay independent</h2>
  <p>Brands cannot pay for a ranking or a review. We earn commissions from some retailers when readers buy through our links, which you can read about on our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> page. Our methods are on <a href="/how-we-test/">how we test</a>.</p>
</Page>
